      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-08-01T14:23:33.788Z",
      "cooked": "<p>IIRC the first turn Timeshift with no Reset produces Disruptive Flechettes.  2 damage to Progeny which he immediately heals, plus someone discards.  On the other hand, Reset may net you the extremely useful Bio-Engineering Beam, but I think it also shuffles away the Technological Advancement which you need to get some Elemental Plating, so that you can tank and use healing beams.  Pulling that off is probably the way to keep OX up, but I never managed it.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-08-01T14:23:33.788Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
